<tab><cl=F0F010>MUTATORS<cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab>A mutator is a magical effect that, for the duration of its action, changes some of the character's characteristics or endows it with additional capabilities. Mutators can be either "positive" (for example, increasing the damage inflicted on the enemy, in which case it makes sense to use them on yourself or on your "brothers in arms") or "negative" (for example, reducing health). All the time the mutator affects your character, there is a shining circle on the right side of the screen. In addition, other players see a glow around a character who is under the influence of a mutator.<br>
}